1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:05,410
(Howard:)I mean, even Donkey Kong
had Donkey Kong Jr.

2
00:00:06,827 --> 00:00:10,207
(Howard:)So he could teach someone
how to kidnap princesses...

3
00:00:10,373 --> 00:00:13,333
(Howard:)...and throw barrels
at Italian plumbers.

4
00:00:15,503 --> 00:00:19,173
(Leonard:)You know, there's no guarantee even if
you have kids you're gonna like them.

5
00:00:19,382 --> 00:00:22,012
(Raj:)Wow, that's rough.
Where'd you get that?

6
00:00:23,886 --> 00:00:26,426
(Leonard:)It's right off the dust jacket
of my mom's last book.

7
00:00:30,476 --> 00:00:33,106
(Howard:)Maybe me and Bernadette
aren't right for each other.

8
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:37,440
(Leonard:)Look, Howard, I'd say
there's a lot of fish in the sea...

9
00:00:37,608 --> 00:00:40,278
(Leonard:)...but I watched you dangle your hook
for years.

10
00:00:40,444 --> 00:00:42,534
(Leonard:)Do not throw her back.

11
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:49,540
(Bernadette:)I don't want to,
but this is kind of a deal breaker.

12
00:00:49,704 --> 00:00:51,744
What will your mom say
if you call off the wedding?

13
00:00:51,914 --> 00:00:55,004
Heh, it'll kill her.
If I don't give her grandchildren...

14
00:00:55,167 --> 00:01:02,027
(Howard:)...that'll kill her too. So either way
on the Mom front, I'm golden.

